(O/'REPORT.md').write_text('''# Original self-review comparison

Only sealed original eligible machine/manual claims were matched against the supplied independent D0 grade rows, using the unchanged frozen match_claims function. Repair uses the supplied D0 and FINAL grade rows through unchanged repair. The comparison.json files contain the exact four function outputs:machine, manual, combined, repair. The evaluator did not read later source/repair narratives or reopen own-corpus observations. Root-executed original machine failures enter regardless of whether a model repeated them.

Source-a has3 exact machine detections of the frozen raw D0 Reserve-height F rows (browse/editing/replaced in P2 Android),0 FP, raw fixed-row recall3/3 and conditional FDR0. There are no eligible manual confirmed claims; manual recall is0/3 for the raw denominator. Combined equals machine. All3 raw F rows map to FINAL P under the fixed-row repair function. These are serialized47.99994000000004dp versus48dp bound comparisons, not established natural product defects. The separate sensitivity panel therefore has a zero established natural-product-defect denominator and N/A natural defect recall/repair attribution. No business/style detection gain is inferred from those numerical differences.

Source-b has no eligible machine/manual confirmed claims and no D0 F rows. Machine/manual/combined recall and conditional FDR are N/A, as is fixed-row repair success. Both arms have zero natural business_current, business_transition and style_native defect denominators; those recall panels stay N/A. Classical FPR is N/A because there is no complete negative claim universe.

The sealed qualitative findings are preserved without promotion:one source-a disabled-readability concern and three source-b concerns. They are unconfirmed, use prose aspects outside the selected24 families, and cannot become TP/FP merely because a later source changed. Exact state/aspect/expectation matching remains equal for machine and manual origins. No repair narrative backfills detection at a different state.

Uncertainty remains visible. Under the frozen adjudicated results source-a conditional FDR is0; including its one unresolved qualitative claim gives conservative unresolved-claim false-discovery-share bounds[0,0.25]. Source-b has no adjudicated claims and three unresolved qualitative findings, so conditional FDR remains N/A; possible unresolved-claim share spans[0,1]. These bounds are separate from frozen function output and do not assert that unmapped findings can be adjudicated inside the selected universe. Numerical-resolution sensitivity separately treats source-a's three raw matched claims as unestablished product defects without changing their primary TP/F-to-P results.

A separate factual addendum corrects the evaluator's earlier claim that all FINAL acquisitions succeeded. Both FINAL P2 iOS observation command JSONs show exit1. Successful compilation and usable partial capture evidence do not establish successful end-to-end XCUITest/acquisition. evaluation/factual-addenda/FINAL-acquisition.json cites exact command hashes and preserves the mistaken wording. Its separate seal changes no D0/FINAL file, scoring row, tool or policy; these acquisition failures are not converted into product-logic F.
''')
